WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.330
Melting ice or toasting bread.

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:05.310
Which is a real chemical change?

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:08.050
Melting ice is still water.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:08.460
Physical.

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:12.220
Toast is a new substance, and you can't untoast it.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.016
Chemical.
